  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>(i) Molecular orbital configuration of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>KK</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#120587;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#120587;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#120587;</mo><mo>*</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#120587;</mo><mo>*</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Bond order =&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>(ii) Molecular orbital configuration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CO</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>KK</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#120587;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#120587;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Bond order =&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>(iii) Molecular orbital configuration of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>NO</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>KK</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#120587;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#120587;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Bond order =&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>So, according&nbsp;to molecular orbital theory, the bond orders&nbsp;respectively are 1, 3 and 3.</p>",
